---
import LegalLayout from '../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
---
<LegalLayout
  title="Delete Your Data — Pick-Up"
  description="How to request deletion of your Pick-Up data. Find your anonymous ID in the app and email it to us; we delete it within 30 days."
  heading="Delete Your Data"
  updated="June 2026"
>
  <div class="note">
    <p><strong>The short version:</strong> Pick-Up does not use named accounts,
    so there is no "delete account" button. To request deletion of your data,
    find your anonymous ID in the App and email it to us. We will delete it
    within 30 days.</p>
  </div>

  <h2>How to Request Deletion</h2>

  <div class="box">
    <p><strong>Step 1 —</strong> Open the Pick-Up app, go to the
    <strong>Settings</strong> tab, and locate your Anonymous ID.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="box">
    <p><strong>Step 2 —</strong> Email your Anonymous ID to
    <a href="mailto:PickUpHelp@proton.me">PickUpHelp@proton.me</a> with the
    subject line "Data Deletion Request." You do not need to provide your
    name, email address used elsewhere, or any other personal information —
    the Anonymous ID is all we use to locate your data.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="box">
    <p><strong>Step 3 —</strong> We will confirm receipt of your request and
    delete the data described below within <strong>30 days</strong>.</p>
  </div>

  <h2>What Gets Deleted</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Your anonymous user ID and all rows associated with it</li>
    <li>Your nickname, if you set one</li>
    <li>Any active or past search (queue) entries</li>
    <li>Your push notification token</li>
    <li>Your membership in any group chats</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>What Is Already Deleted Automatically</h2>
  <p>
    Some data is never retained long enough to need a manual deletion
    request, because it is removed automatically as part of normal App
    operation:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>Your precise location — removed as soon as your search ends, expires, or you are matched</li>
    <li>Group chat messages — automatically deleted 48 hours after the chat is created</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>What May Be Retained</h2>
  <p>
    If another user has submitted a report involving your account, that
    report (including the reason and a snapshot of related messages) may be
    retained for moderation and safety purposes, even after your deletion
    request is processed. This is necessary to maintain the integrity of our
    moderation system and prevent its misuse — for example, to ensure a
    deletion request cannot be used to erase evidence of a policy violation.
    This is also described in our <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Questions</h2>
  <p>
    If you have any questions about this process, contact us at
    <a href="mailto:PickUpHelp@proton.me">PickUpHelp@proton.me</a>.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>